Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 07:17:39 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 08/12] event_extensions:CPER: Add Raw extension

Add a CPER Raw event extension implementation.

Implement create, restore, and serialize support for the
CPER Raw extension. Raw CPER payloads are persisted as
artifacts, exposed through the CPER Raw D-Bus interface,
and cleaned up when the owning log entry is deleted.

Register the extension with the builtin event extension
framework and add unit tests covering extension
registration.

This change exercises artifact persistence and cleanup
through the event extension lifecycle.

Change-Id: I9a12e52e0b8f6c34e1734a25c9da3963eb64f48e
Signed-off-by: Jayanth Othayoth <ojayanth@gmail.com>
